1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:52,320
4 months later

25
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:54,320
Valley above the
Immortal Graveyard

26
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,080
If I enter a spatial rift,

27
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:03,640
I will lose my anchor point to the outside.

28
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,640
But if I don't,

29
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,320
it will be difficult to find my avatar...

30
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,800
This person is bad news.

31
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,250
Fellow cultivator,

32
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:36,050
we don’t even know each other.

33
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,720
Why must you act like this ?!

34
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:40,310
There were 7 of you when you entered.

35
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,720
Why did only the two of you come out ?

36
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,480
I’ve never met him before

37
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:48,720
so why does he feel somewhat familiar ?

38
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:49,920
No answer ?

39
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,400
You can die then.

40
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,600
Senior,

41
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:55,560
among the other 5, there must be someone you know.

42
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,800
Junior admits her mistake.

43
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:00,960
After my father disappeared in the Immortal Graveyard

44
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,080
I was sold to the country of Suzaku.

45
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,190
I became a cultivation furnace,

46
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,920
living a life worse than death.

47
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:08,890
I refused to accept it

48
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,200
and luckily managed to escape.

49
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:12,280
That's when I met Elder Gongsun.

50
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,510
He didn’t abandon me

51
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,150
and has protected me ever since.

52
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,200
He was even willing to accompany me to the Immortal Graveyard

53
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,960
to search for traces of my father.

54
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,940
To divert the attention of the Forsaken Immortal Clan,

55
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,600
I used the Reincarnation Fruits as bait.

56
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,200
and invited 5 others to join me.

57
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,400
But I failed to find my father

58
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,600
so I had no choice but to leave.

59
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,320
Senior,

60
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,240
I was the one who hid the truth.

61
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,000
If Senior wants to kill someone,

62
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,920
then kill this Junior.

63
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,800
Don’t hurt Elder Gongsun.

64
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,520
Miss,

65
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,080
let him kill me.

66
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,680
I would rather die now

67
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,240
than live as someone's tattoo puppet.

68
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,880
Find Wang Lin

69
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,320
and I'll let you two live.

70
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:30,640
Impossible,

71
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,120
how could a furnace chosen by Suzaku

72
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,800
have escaped so easily ?

73
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:38,260
Gongsun Fan was clearly marked by a tattoo seed

74
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,760
yet he’s different from the others,

75
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,440
and they managed to escape unscathed.

76
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:43,920
There must be

77
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,400
someone else backing them.

78
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,400
I left drops of blood within their bodies

79
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,800
so that I can find my way.

80
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:57,920
A few days later

81
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,400
Senior...

82
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,840
I...

83
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,320
Senior...

84
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,680
The thing is,

85
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,240
this was all your fault.

86
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,160
Wait !

87
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:32,220
This trip to the Immortal Graveyard was truly perilous.

88
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,320
Fortunately,

89
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:36,520
I obtained a Reincarnation Fruit needed for my body cleansing.

90
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:52,920
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

91
00:05:53,080 --> 00:06:00,660
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
like the descent of a god.

92
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,360
I have finally become

93
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,520
a true Ancient God.

94
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,640
3 years later

95
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,320
Our Apricot Village

96
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:22,440
is undergoing the Heaven's Path Sect's recruitment.

97
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:25,280
Son, listen carefully to what they say.

98
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,920
If any child is chosen

99
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:29,040
it will be a great honor for its family.

100
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,040
Yes !

101
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,520
Zhou Ru
5 years old

102
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,600
Next

103
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,440
None of them have Spirit Roots...

104
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,640
This kid,

105
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,000
I’ll take her.

106
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,080
Immortal,

107
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:57,280
this child is born mute.

108
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,000
No problem.

109
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,120
Thank you, Immortal

110
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,080
Ru’er,

111
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,880
bow to your master.

112
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:05,880
Hurry...

113
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,160
This child is so fortunate !

114
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,160
Innate spiritual energy,

115
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,040
all her meridians are opened,

116
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,600
and a purple aura.

117
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,160
Move faster, damn it !

118
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,360
If I miss the spirit stone exchange,

119
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,720
you’ll regret it !

120
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:46,600
Stupid girl !

121
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,520
I’ll beat you to death.

122
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,080
Do you dare ?

123
00:07:58,960 --> 00:07:59,880
Senior...

124
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:00,600
I...

125
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,640
Wan’er...

126
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:32,440
Uncle

127
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,400
Can you speak ?

128
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:46,760
Would you like to cultivate with me ?

129
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:58,360
She will eventually step into cultivation world.

130
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,600
Since her parents can’t protect her,

131
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:03,860
I might as well take her with me

132
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,440
to ensure her safety.

133
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,040
Ceng Niu,

134
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,040
come out and fight me !

135
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:11,760
Ceng Niu,

136
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,960
