138
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,440
Are you afraid of losing ?

139
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,200
We’re home.

140
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:32,240
Hungry ?

141
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,920
The chopsticks are flying !

142
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:14,680
Go ahead.

143
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,480
Why don't you eat ?

144
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,820
Once you reach a certain level of cultivation

145
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,560
