146
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:36,680
I dreamed that my parents were gone.

147
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:39,800
Everything around me was pitch black.

148
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:40,720
Only...

149
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:43,800
Only I was left.

150
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,040
I’m here,

151
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,080
don’t be afraid.

152
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:51,160
What if you’re not here in the future ?

153
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,880
So shiny...

154
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,000
This is for you.

155
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,680
If you ever need me,

156
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,040
just shake it

157
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,760
and I’ll appear.

158
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:15,840
Wan’er...

159
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,840
Ceng Niu,

160
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,120
you coward !

161
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,360
Do you dare to come out and fight ?

162
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,040
Ceng Niu,

163
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:22,760
come out and fight me !

164
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,560
I’ll let you take one of my arms.

165
00:11:24,340 --> 00:11:25,560
I’ll let you take both of my arms !

166
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:34,840
Attack !

167
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,080
You're noisy.

168
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:10,160
10-ingredients tonic soup

169
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,600
Come and take a look !

170
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,560
Do you like it ?

171
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,960
Dad, I want this !

172
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:21,640
Alright

173
00:12:26,710 --> 00:12:27,440
It's delicious !

174
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:30,840
Slow down !

175
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:11,520
Uncle,

176
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:13,820
help me to capture this little pet.

177
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:28,710
If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes,

178
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:31,560
I wouldn’t have believed Wan’er was like this.

179
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:41,360
5 years later

180
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,120
Uncle !

181
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:42,880
What's the matter ?

182
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:42,360
Wang Lin's avatar
Middle stage Soul Formation

183
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:45,960
Zhou Ru
10 years old

184
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,280
Nothing.

185
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:50,560
Little Ru'er,

186
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:51,640
hide in the pagoda.

187
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:55,640
Ceng Niu, come out !

188
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,450
Xue Ye’s Liao Fen is here

189
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,280
to ask for the feather fan back.

190
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,000
Liao Fan
Country of Xue Yue
Late stage Soul Formation

191
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,160
Ceng Niu,

192
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,120
I am here to settle the grudge

193
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,040
between you

194
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,440
and Xue Yue !

195
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,040
Kill !

196
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,880
If you are only this strong,

197
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,210
then you will

198
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,360
meet your end.

199
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:26,360
Today is the 17th of March.

200
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:27,520
Ceng Niu,

201
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,520
this is the day you die !

202
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,720
Sonic Wave Spirit Armor !

203
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:05,080
Which one of you bastards dared to hurt me ?

204
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,200
This voice...

205
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:08,440
Is this...

206
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:11,800
the chilling aura of the Underworld Ascension Method ?

207
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:16,570
Quickly find a Yin energy gathering location

208
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:19,280
to cultivate the Underworld Ascension Method.

209
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,440
Underworld Ice Flame ?

210
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,520
How do you know this technique ?

211
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,520
Who the hell are you ?

212
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:40,730
It wouldn't hurt to tell you,

213
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:41,720
my name is

214
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,120
Situ Nan !

215
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:02,720
Go away !

216
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,040
Situ Nan...

217
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,360
How could this be ?

218
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:30,760
Impossible...

219
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:32,720
Impossible !

220
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,560
Senior Situ,

221
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,000
if that really was your severed arm,

222
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,600
then I kind of believe what you said back then.

223
00:16:50,040 --> 00:17:02,670
Note: "Suzaku" is the name of the country and planet
"the Suzaku" is the title of strongest individual on planet Suzaku

224
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:52,160
But the title of Suzaku's strongest person

225
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,120
is held by the one and only Suzaku.

226
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:57,760
Were you

227
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:59,880
really the Suzaku ?

228
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:03,560
Senior Situ,

229
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,040
the 10-year agreement is near.

230
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:08,840
My chances of winning this battle are slim

231
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,440
but there’s no avoiding it.

232
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,640
Little White,

233
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:15,360
