234
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:17,480
Look down !

235
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,880
Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,

236
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,760
The 10-year agreement is up.

237
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:27,480
Mount Suzaku ordered me

238
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:29,640
to escort you.

239
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,360
Tie Yan,

240
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,160
Yes ?

241
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,800
The Thunder Frog and the pagoda

242
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:39,800
will stay here.

243
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,440
No one can enter within a 100 li radius.

244
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:43,760
While I’m gone,

245
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,920
take good care of Little Ru’er for me.

246
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:47,320
Benefactor, don’t worry.

247
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:49,520
This old man will ensure the safety

248
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:51,360
of lady Ru’er.

249
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,160
Little Ru’er,

250
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:55,680
come here.

251
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:57,320
Bad Uncle !

252
00:17:57,560 --> 00:18:00,080
You go out to play by yourself without taking Little Ru'er.

253
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,280
While I’m away,

254
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:10,120
listen to Uncle Tie Yan.

255
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,510
When I come back,

256
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:13,160
I’ll catch an even bigger tiger for you.

257
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:15,720
Really ?

258
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,280
Even bigger than Little White ?

259
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,920
Even bigger than Little White.

260
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,640
Okay,

261
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,160
but you have to come back quickly.

262
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:41,000
Uncle !

263
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:45,840
Uncle...

264
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,360
You must return safely...

265
00:18:51,560 --> 00:18:52,200
Alright,

266
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,480
you also take care of yourself.

267
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,240
Master !

268
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,400
I’ve thoroughly investigated Ceng Niu’s strength

269
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,040
Tell me.

270
00:19:27,770 --> 00:19:28,600
This Ceng Niu

271
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:30,680
is now at Middle stage Soul Formation.

272
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:31,820
His domain

273
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:34,530
seems to be the Life and Death reincarnation cycle.

274
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:36,550
He has a flying sword that can chop anything

275
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,840
Li Yuanfeng
Xue Yue's Suzerain
Early stage Soul Transformation

276
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,880
and a mysterious pagoda.

277
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,560
Not only that

278
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:42,240
but I used the treasure you gave me to test him

279
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:43,160
and he...

280
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,320
also masters the Underworld Ascension Method.

281
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,520
In the past,

282
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:49,480
he severed Red Butterfly’s arm.

283
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,040
And now,

284
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:53,120
he caught the attention of the Suzaku.

285
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:56,040
How could he be an ordinary person ?

286
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:58,000
So what you told me before,

287
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,590
do we forget about it ?

288
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,920
It’s not the right time yet,

289
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:05,440
I’ve already set up the trap.

290
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:08,040
After he fights Red Butterfly,

291
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:10,160
I’ll make my move.

292
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,480
Regardless of the outcome,

293
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:18,120
Ceng Niu

294
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:20,480
will die for sure.

295
00:20:57,430 --> 00:21:00,730
To let go of the consequences of my actions

296
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:02,450
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

297
00:21:02,490 --> 00:21:04,390
like scattered ink.

298
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:11,870
As destiny falls

299
00:21:08,110 --> 00:21:11,870
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

300
00:21:11,870 --> 00:21:19,470
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

301
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:19,470
wither and melt into rivers.

302
00:21:19,910 --> 00:21:27,030
Who can deceive

303
00:21:22,670 --> 00:21:27,030
the law of the heavens ?

304
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:30,350
Countless generations

305
00:21:28,630 --> 00:21:30,350
have tried before me.

306
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:34,070
But how could I not catch my dreams

307
00:21:32,470 --> 00:21:34,070
within my warm fingers ?

308
00:21:34,630 --> 00:21:38,150
You're at my side when I'm alone

309
00:21:38,150 --> 00:21:41,470
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

310
00:21:42,230 --> 00:21:45,430
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

311
00:21:45,790 --> 00:21:49,630
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

312
00:21:47,630 --> 00:21:49,630
in the streets.

313
00:21:49,790 --> 00:21:54,590
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

314
00:21:51,350 --> 00:21:54,590
Can I break the rules ?

315
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:57,310
To run towards you !

316
00:21:57,350 --> 00:22:00,630
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

317
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:05,270
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

318
00:22:05,270 --> 00:22:08,670
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

319
00:22:08,710 --> 00:22:13,350
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

320
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:19,030
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

321
00:22:19,150 --> 00:22:22,950
If your soul is willing to wander,

322
00:22:22,950 --> 00:22:27,590
can I still take your hands

323
00:22:24,630 --> 00:22:27,590
and hold them tight ?

324
00:22:27,750 --> 00:22:30,670
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

325
00:22:30,670 --> 00:22:35,550
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

326
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:38,830
I dream of destroying

327
00:22:38,990 --> 00:22:43,550
the shackles of our fate.

328
00:22:43,550 --> 00:22:47,510
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

329
00:22:47,510 --> 00:22:50,310
You're the hardest to let go of.

330
00:22:50,390 --> 00:22:54,190
I want to be with you again

331
00:22:54,270 --> 00:22:57,550
so I can look in your eyes.

332
00:22:57,830 --> 00:23:02,790
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
